  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voix du Sahel - Voice of the Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal or impact of the project Voix du Sahel &#x2013; informer pour la paix et l&#x2019;engagement citoyen (&#x201c;Voice of the Sahel &#x2013; informing for peace and civic engagement&#x201d;) is to contribute to peace consolidation and the emergence of a democratic public space, through the promotion of reliable, independent, inclusive, and citizen-oriented information. The Project seeks to strengthen social cohesion and democratic dialogue at national and regional/local levels, while enhancing community resilience against disinformation and manipulation. It will emphasize the role of media as a driver of peacebuilding, civic participation, and inclusive governance. The project is implemented in Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso.</narrative>
  </description>
